# Volatile Wanderglyph (2/2): "Whenever this creature becomes tapped, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card." Attacking
# taps it (CR 508.1f): on turn 3 Bot1 draws the Mountain, attacks, discards the Island and draws the Savannah from the top of the
# library (hand 5 -> 4 -> 5). The Wanderglyph's 2 damage reaches Bot2.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Volatile Wanderglyph
Island
Swamp
Forest
Plains
Mountain
Savannah
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Volatile Wanderglyph.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Volatile Wanderglyph > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Mountain; Plains; Savannah; Swamp
Bot2.Life = 18
